-* AnalogCoder-Pro p26: An Opamp adder to make Vout=-(Vin1+Vin2)
-* Source: analogcoder\AnalogCoderPro-master\sample_design\p26\p26.py
-* AnalogCoder-Pro type: Adder
-* Inputs: Vin1, Vin2
-* Outputs: Vout
-
-* Opamp subcircuit imported from AnalogCoder-Pro opamp.py
